We can't let these pigs win!

252
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:11,357
If you die, what's gonna
happen to me an alien?

253
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,860
Let go of me, dammit!

254
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,428
